{"id":"n95ebd826cb","headline":"62 commercial vessels redirected, three disabled amid US blockade on Iran: CENTCOM","summary":"US Central Command said its forces have redirected 62 commercial vessels, disabled three and boarded two while enforcing a blockade against Iran. The action comes amid competing claims over control of the Strait of Hormuz.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz is a major chokepoint for global oil shipments, so disruptions there affect crude prices and shipping costs.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Strait of Hormuz","country":"Iran","lat":26.56,"lon":56.25,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/global-trends/62-commercial-vessels-redirected-three-disabled-amid-us-blockade-on-iran-centcom/articleshow/133256189.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/global-trends/62-commercial-vessels-redirected-three-disabled-amid-us-blockade-on-iran-centcom/articleshow/133256189.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-08-15T04:58:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"b841df2524268ef9","impacts":[],"why_moved":"The input reports vessels redirected and disabled amid competing claims over the Strait of Hormuz, a key oil transit route, which raises supply-disruption risk.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-15T04:58:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-15T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IR","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-7338168.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit":"analogicus","license":"Pixabay Cont